		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Purple, crystalline ooze that petrifies unwary targets, feeding and growing.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 9, <strong>HP</strong> 52, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tentacle +7 (2d8 + crystallize), <strong>MV</strong> close (climb), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -4, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> -3, <strong>Ch</strong> -4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Crystalline</strong>. Immune to cold, fire. If smashed, splits into two smaller crystals (divide remaining HP between both). Can split up to four times.</p><p></p><p><strong>Crystallize</strong>. Any creature touched by the crystal, CON 15+ or immobilized and encased in crystal, STR 15+ on turn to escape. Encased creatures failing a second check are turned to crystal.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
